            "or React component, each invocation adds another listener to the same emitter. "
            "After 1000 requests you have 1000 handlers firing on every event. "
            "Fix: const handler = (data) => { ... }; emitter.on('event', handler); "
            "// in cleanup: emitter.off('event', handler); "
            "In Node 20+, use the signal option: emitter.on('event', handler, { signal: ac.signal })."
